    "xtu_rich_content_xWzDGq": {
      "type": "xtu-rich-content",
      "blocks": {
        "richtext_BmDGmM": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>Adjustable Voltage Protection for 24H Parking Monitoring</strong></p>",
            "align": "center",
            "font_size": 24,
            "font_size_mobile": 16,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_3y47m6": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p>Power your compatible GKU dash cam with the GKU Multi-Size Type-C Hardwire Kit. Featuring adjustable low-voltage protection, a stable 5V/2.5A output, and 8 fuse taps across 4 common types, it provides reliable power for continuous driving and supported parking monitoring.</p><p><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul><li>Adjustable Low-Voltage Protection (11.3V–13.5V)</li><li>24H Parking Monitoring Support</li><li>4 Fuse Types & 8 Fuse Taps</li><li>12V–24V Input / 5V/2.5A Output</li><li>9.8 ft / 3m Type-C Cable</li><li>Built-In Safety Protection</li></ul>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "image_8m7aCi": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/JYX0001_a6e7b061-998a-4bcd-b53d-2e57ae59091e.png",
            "media_ratio": "auto",
            "alt": "GKU hardwire kit for 24-hour parking monitoring, compatible with GKU dash cams",
            "image_width": 100,
            "align": "center",
            "image_radius": 16,
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_mc4zHh": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>Professional Installation Recommended:</strong><br/>Installation requires connection to your vehicle’s fuse box. Vehicle electrical systems vary by model, so professional installation is recommended to help ensure safe and correct wiring.</p><p><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0637/6135/0883/files/GKU-V9H_3A.pdf?v=1779175986\"><strong>View the User Manual</strong></a></p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_xwC8mr": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>Adjustable Low-Voltage Protection</strong></p>",
            "align": "center",
            "font_size": 24,
            "font_size_mobile": 16,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_9n6bwb": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>Customizable Battery Protection</strong></p><p>Adjust the voltage cutoff threshold between 11.3V and 13.5V to suit your vehicle's battery requirements.</p><p>The hardwire kit automatically disconnects power when the battery voltage falls below the selected threshold, helping prevent excessive battery discharge during parking monitoring.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_aeWarc": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>24H Parking Protection, Automatically Activated<br/></strong></p>",
            "align": "center",
            "font_size": 24,
            "font_size_mobile": 16,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_fzpwBc": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p>The GKU ACC Hardwire Kit keeps your compatible dash cam powered after the engine is turned off, allowing parking monitoring to continue while your vehicle is unattended.</p><p>Built-in ACC detection automatically recognizes the vehicle's ignition status:</p><p><strong>Engine On → Driving Recording</strong><br/><strong>Engine Off → Parking Monitoring</strong></p><p><br/>Compatible with 12V–24V vehicle electrical systems, including cars, SUVs, EVs, trucks, vans and buses.<br/><br/></p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "image_wDFY7C": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/b22bf0de-2bd8-4f93-83f6-27f2c3b0556d.__CR0_0_1464_600_PT0_SX1464_V1_814c93aa-133e-4654-a2b8-e293249c6fd1.jpg",
            "media_ratio": "auto",
            "alt": "GKU hardwire kit for 12V–24V cars, trucks, SUVs, buses and vans with 24-hour parking monitoring",
            "image_width": 100,
            "align": "center",
            "image_radius": 18,
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_CXEUXh": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>Depending on your dash cam model, parking monitoring may include:</strong></p><p><strong>G-Sensor Collision Detection</strong><br/>Automatically starts recording when an impact or sudden vibration is detected.</p><p><strong>Time-Lapse Recording</strong><br/>Records continuously at a lower frame rate to capture longer parking periods while reducing storage and power consumption.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "image_r6hCkM": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/9e9f30e0-1d4c-4441-b748-9569008c78c6.__CR0_0_1464_600_PT0_SX1464_V1_2985c75a-7135-4a64-9356-614c2b831be5.jpg",
            "media_ratio": "auto",
            "alt": "GKU dash cam parking monitoring with G-sensor collision detection and time-lapse recording, hardwire kit required",
            "image_width": 100,
            "align": "center",
            "image_radius": 16,
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_86HTwD": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>Adjustable Low-Voltage & Safety Protection</strong></p>",
            "align": "center",
            "font_size": 24,
            "font_size_mobile": 16,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_k9EW86": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>Customizable Battery Protection for Reliable Parking Power</strong></p><p>Set the voltage cutoff between 11.3V and 13.5V to suit your vehicle's battery requirements.</p><p>When battery voltage falls below the selected threshold, the hardwire kit automatically disconnects power to help prevent excessive battery discharge.</p><p>Designed for compatible Type-C dash cams, it provides a stable 5V/2.5A output with built-in safety protection.</p><p><strong>Safety Features</strong></p><ul><li>Adjustable Low-Voltage Protection</li><li>Over-Current Protection</li><li>Short-Circuit Protection</li><li>Overheat Protection</li></ul><p><em><strong>Note: </strong></em><em>This kit is not compatible with Mini USB or Micro USB dash cams and is not recommended for vehicle electrical systems above 24V.</em></p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_ecM6KU": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>Clean and Permanent Installation</strong></p>",
            "align": "center",
            "font_size": 24,
            "font_size_mobile": 16,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_YBdcYa": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p><strong>Concealed Wiring for a Cleaner Dashboard</strong></p><p>The 9.8 ft (3m) Type-C cable provides flexible routing for a neat, permanent installation.</p><p><strong>Benefits</strong></p><ul><li>Reduces visible cable clutter</li><li>Keeps the cigarette lighter port available</li><li>Creates a cleaner, factory-style appearance</li><li>Provides a permanent power connection</li><li>9.8 ft / 3m cable for flexible routing</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Wiring Guide&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Red Wire — ACC</strong></p><p>Connect to an ignition-switched fuse.</p><p><strong>Yellow Wire — BATT</strong></p><p>Connect to a constant-power fuse.</p><p><strong>Black Wire — GND</strong></p><p>Connect to a suitable metal grounding point.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "image_aCbU7N": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/14e8ebef-df09-4be5-a1dc-0e1d5c881a8e.__CR0_0_1464_600_PT0_SX1464_V1_0f2e878a-f45b-45b1-9288-4b2b0b6d4f15.jpg",
            "media_ratio": "auto",
            "alt": "GKU hardwire kit wiring overview with ACC, battery, ground wires and 11.5 ft cable length",
